<title>USA: TF Purifiner says names Hart president.</title>
<headline>TF Purifiner says names Hart president.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>TF Purifiner Inc said Wednesday it named Keith Hart president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Prior to joining TF Purifiner, Hart served as president of Florida Detroit Diesel.</p>
</text>
